{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>「穿著就能恢復體力」的機能修復衣最近大受歡迎，以往高不可攀的修復衣，如今由Donki自家品牌「情熱價格」開展平價市場，推出全新「ド 回復WEAR」系列！這款產品專為每天面對高壓工作、家務與育兒的30至40歲上班族及主婦設計，主打「邊打工邊修復」。特殊布料中融入了特殊礦物質，能釋放遠赤外線促進血液循環，持續舒緩肌肉緊繃與酸痛。除了當睡衣外，更能直接作為日常打底內衣穿著，材質貼身舒適。港幣約 HK$50 起就能入手，大家想試試嗎？</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178516809365463896_18604832356a6780de1f51e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178516809593511830_1055889176a6780e04ebe8.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178516809778272443_7697927656a6780e22ac07.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178516809957438558_19736729206a6780e3e7fdc.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178516810116968763_10953160486a6780e5877a3.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-27T16:19:25.632110+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":284,"images":5,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}